          "text": "Hailing from the culturally rich city of Mysore, Karnataka, Rashmi was surrounded by a vibrant artistic community from a young age. Her passion for the ancient art of Bharatanatyam blossomed early and led her to train under the legendary Guru Dr. Vasundara Doraswamy for over 12 years, mastering both technique and expression.",
