          "fontFamily": "Playfair Display",
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "text": "During a battle, the demon Raktabija seemed unstoppable because every drop of his blood that spilled created new demons instantly. To stop this endless army, Goddess Kali fiercely drank all his blood before it touched the ground. With no blood left to fall, the copies stopped appearing, and she could finally defeat and kill the original Raktabija. ",
