          "fontFamily": "Playfair Display",
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "text": "She was subsequently selected by Dance New Jersey to present her original choreography at its Sunday Salon and Show Up & Dance programs hosted at Stockton University.",
