          "skewX": 0,
          "skewY": 0,
          "fontFamily": "Playfair Display",
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "text": "S G Pramath Kiran, a distinguished percussionist, music producer, and sound engineer, is a leading musician in India. Having embarked on his musical journey at the age of 3, he possesses expertise in both Carnatic and Hindustani music. Renowned for collaborations with top musicians worldwide, he founded Laya Digi Studios, producing numerous records. Notably, he's a featured artist in a Grammy award-winning album Devine Tides by Ricky Kej, showcasing his exceptional musical prowess.",
          "underline": false,
          "overline": false,
          "linethrough": false,
          "textAlign": "justify-left",
