          "fontFamily": "Playfair Display",
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "text": "Beyond performing, Krishna Prasad is deeply committed to passing on his knowledge and expertise to aspiring students. He continues his father's legacy as a guru, nurturing hundreds of students worldwide, many of whom have gone on to perform internationally.His journey is a testament to the universal language of music, bridging cultures and continents while maintaining a deep-rooted connection to the rich traditions of Carnatic music.",
